WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:06.062
Badger, Mole, Rat, and Toad jumped into the room.

2
00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:09.053
They had their weapons ready.

3
00:00:09.054 --> 00:00:14.022
They stood side by side like heroes.

4
00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:19.377
"Ahhh!" the Wild-Wooders screamed.

5
00:00:19.378 --> 00:00:24.935
"It's Badger!" they cried. "Run!"

6
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:29.224
Badger swung his club in the air.

7
00:00:29.225 --> 00:00:32.859
"Come on, Mole!" shouted Badger.

8
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.295
Mole's sword was ready.

9
00:00:35.296 --> 00:00:39.242
"Get out, you bullies!" yelled Mole.

10
00:00:39.243 --> 00:00:43.218
Scared weasels hid under tables.

11
00:00:43.219 --> 00:00:47.080
Ferrets rushed up the chimney.

12
00:00:47.081 --> 00:00:50.281
"You can't get away!" yelled Rat.

13
00:00:50.282 --> 00:00:54.323
Glasses and plates crashed to the floor.

14
00:00:54.324 --> 00:00:57.340
Pictures fell from the walls.

15
00:00:57.341 --> 00:01:01.748
Toad puffed up with anger!

16
00:01:01.749 --> 00:01:06.144
"Sing songs about me?" cried Toad.

17
00:01:06.145 --> 00:01:09.886
"Make fun of me?" he shouted.

18
00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:12.212
"Never!"

19
00:01:12.213 --> 00:01:16.793
Toad lifted his club high in the air.

20
00:01:16.794 --> 00:01:20.740
He ran toward the Chief Weasel.

21
00:01:20.741 --> 00:01:24.365
"Don't hit me!" cried the Chief Weasel.

22
00:01:24.366 --> 00:01:28.011
"I was just having some fun."

23
00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:32.812
"You stole my house!" yelled Toad.

24
00:01:32.813 --> 00:01:36.494
He hit the Chief Weasel on the head.

25
00:01:36.495 --> 00:01:40.095
"Ow!" cried the Chief Weasel.

26
00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:44.058
He fell out of his chair with a thud.

27
00:01:44.059 --> 00:01:47.968
Badger, Rat, and Mole fought hard.

28
00:01:47.969 --> 00:01:52.079
They pushed their enemies into a corner.

29
00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:55.804
"We're trapped!" screamed the Chief Weasel.

30
00:01:55.805 --> 00:02:00.148
"The window! It's the only way out!"

31
00:02:00.149 --> 00:02:03.491
The weasels jumped through the glass.

32
00:02:03.492 --> 00:02:09.019
They ran across the lawn and into the night.

